    <node id="sym:repo2graph/export.py::_separate">
      <data key="d0">sym:repo2graph/export.py::_separate</data>
      <data key="d1">symbol</data>
      <data key="d2">_separate</data>
      <data key="d9">_separate</data>
      <data key="d10">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/export.py</data>
      <data key="d5">python</data>
      <data key="d11">168</data>
      <data key="d12">206</data>
      <data key="d13">def _separate(pos, sizes, iterations):</data>
      <data key="d14">Push overlapping boxes apart; the spring layout only knows points.

    The grid cell is as wide as the widest box, so two overlapping boxes always
    share a cell or sit in adjacent ones and no pair is missed.</data>
