      <data key="d13">def _base_clauses(node):</data>
      <data key="d14">Supertype clauses of a definition, preferring the innermost one.

    TypeScript wraps extends_clause/implements_clause in a class_heritage and
    Java wraps a type_list in super_interfaces; the outer node's text would join
    several names into one string, so descend when a child is a clause too.</data>
