      <data key="d13">def read_jsonl(path: Path) -&gt; list:</data>
      <data key="d14">Load a JSONL file written by export.write_jsonl.

    newline="\n" matters: json.dumps(ensure_ascii=False) passes U+2028, U+2029
    and U+0085 through verbatim, and both str.splitlines() and universal-newline
    mode treat those as line breaks, which would cut records in half.</data>
